MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Buc_m01_001: Bertrand used to be a general in Arago—his future in\nthe kingdom looked bright.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Buc_m01_002: Lord Guillermo certainly respected and trusted him.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Buc_m01_003: That was why he responded to Bertrand's request\nfor parley.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Buc_m01_004: Then came the single arrow that Lechner loosed\nfrom the ramparts...
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Buc_m01_005: It's unbearable, wondering how differently things\nwould have gone if not for that. 
MID_LGA_1LED_c12_Buc_m01: <BLN>I cannot bear the thought.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Sci_m01_001: Miss Leda, a word of caution. You will not win\nfacing the White-Maned Demon distracted.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Sci_m01_002: This is the man who was given the Trial of the\nChariot and survived.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Sci_m01_003: His skills are doubtless unrivaled in the colosseum's\nlong history.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Sci_m01_004: Please, do not allow your lust for revenge to cloud\nyour eyes during the fight ahead.
MID_LGA_1LED_c12_Sci_m01: <BLN>A word of caution.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Moo_m01_001: I've been thinking... After this match, I'm gonna have\na talk with my mom.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Moo_m01_002: Y'know. Hear what she has to say. Try to say how I\nfeel with words and stuff.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Moo_m01_003: If we still end up fighting afterward, then I guess I\nhave to give up.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Moo_m01_004: But it seems like it's worth one more shot—talking to\nher about what I do next.
MID_LGA_1LED_c12_Moo_m01: <BLN>I've been thinking.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Oly_m01_001: At long last, your showdown with Bertrand! What an\neventful journey it's been to get here.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Oly_m01_002: Hmm. You seem strangely unaffected, Leilidahna.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Oly_m01_003: Indeed, as if you've been liberated from some terrible\nburden. I suppose we had nothing to fret about then!
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Oly_m01_004: In that case, all that's left is to put in your best effort.\nWe must be prepared for anything!
MID_LGA_1LED_c12_Oly_m01: <BLN>Put in your best effort!
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01_001: The time has finally come for your long-held desire\nto be fulfilled.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01_002: I can't help but be astonished you made it this far.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01_003: It was your indefatigable nature that brought you to\nthis match.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01_004: There's nothing more for me to say now.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01_005: Other than...expend every effort, and rely on\nyour friends. Do your very best.
MID_LGV_1LED_c12_Car_m01_006: No matter the outcome, shine brightly enough that\nyou may have nothing to regret.
MID_LGA_1LED_c12_Car_m01: <BLN>Expend every effort.